{"version":1,"content":"<p>一名IT技術員日前在尖沙嘴港鐵站從後向女子腿部淋白色不明液體，警方經翻查閉路電視，昨日（15日）將他拘捕，相信涉及年初另外兩宗同類案件，而兩女事主事發後並未報案。</p><p>據了解，涉案男子專向穿短裙長靴的年輕女性落手，涉案的白色不明液體有待化驗。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T10:19:50.460480+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T10:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T02:57:34.630920+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T10:17:36.682037+00:00","content_hash":"524e2654bff64365276dd5eb5467753a3be6831c1b12e4ecadb3ff6f90689c12","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}